VulkanMod Reforged

A Vulkan renderer for Minecraft 1.21.1 on NeoForge.
Alpha build. Recent compatibility checks cover specific mod versions, not every modpack.

Downloads: https://github.com/TrulyRin/VulkanMod-Reforged/releases
Build: ./gradlew assemble
Java: 21

An unofficial fork of https://github.com/xCollateral/VulkanMod
Maintained by Rindw (TrulyRin). See NOTICE for attribution.
